<div class="head"><div><h1>Policy · fixture</h1>
<p class="lede rules-ctx">Basic (Landlock) · run <a class="mono link" href="/runs/r-aaaaaaaa-0000000000006-askedx" title="r-aaaaaaaa-0000000000006-askedx">r-…PATH</a> · running · <span class="code-i" title="…PATH">…PATH</span></p></div>
<div class="head-actions"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/rules/change?c=…PATH"><svg class="i" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="/static/sprite.svg#i-scroll-text"/></svg>Edit policy</a></div></div>

<form class="frow rules-pick" action="/rules" method="get" aria-label="Choose the rules to show">
  <label class="field rp-file">Policy file<select class="select" name="c"><option value="…PATH" selected>fixture · …PATH</option></select></label>
  <label class="field rp-run">Run<select class="select" name="run"><option value="r-aaaaaaaa-0000000000006-askedx" selected>r-…PATH</option></select></label>
  <button class="btn" type="submit">Show</button>
</form>


<section class="panel rules-pending rp-live" aria-labelledby="h-pending"><div class="panel-head"><h2 id="h-pending"><svg class="i" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="/static/sprite.svg#i-scroll-text"/></svg>Rules file differs from this run</h2></div><div class="panel-body stack-sm">
  <p class="soft">The next run of <span class="code-i">…PATH</span> gets the file's rules as they are now · this run keeps its own</p>
  
  <p>The file's rules differ from what this run ran, and nothing dates the change: a profile it extends changed, or this run started from another version of the file · not live on this run</p>
  <p class="soft">To apply all: stop it (<a class="link" href="/runs/r-aaaaaaaa-0000000000006-askedx/stop">Stop this run</a>); its next run gets these rules:</p>
  <div class="cli"><code>tego run …PATH</code></div><p class="soft"><span title="Same policy file and command; add options the run was started with, such as --tier or --record">Restart with</span></p>
</div></section>

<p class="note"><svg class="i" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="/static/sprite.svg#i-scroll-text"/></svg><span>Line numbers are the run&#39;s own copy of its rules: the rules file no longer loads to the rules this run ran.</span></p>
<p class="note"><svg class="i" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="/static/sprite.svg#i-shield"/></svg><span>The run left no copy of its rules.</span></p>




<section class="panel rules-g" aria-labelledby="g-read"><div class="panel-head"><h2 id="g-read"><svg class="i" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="/static/sprite.svg#i-eye"/></svg>Can read <span class="soft">Files the agent can open and read.</span></h2></div>

<div class="panel-foot rules-default"><span>Can read any other file on this computer, except the ones under Never reads and Always on.</span></div></section><section class="panel rules-g" aria-labelledby="g-change"><div class="panel-head"><h2 id="g-change"><svg class="i" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="/static/sprite.svg#i-scroll-text"/></svg>Can change <span class="soft">Files and folders the agent can create, edit or delete.</span></h2></div>

<div class="panel-foot rules-default"><span>Cannot change any file.</span></div></section><section class="panel rules-g" aria-labelledby="g-programs"><div class="panel-head"><h2 id="g-programs"><svg class="i" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="/static/sprite.svg#i-terminal"/></svg>Programs <span class="soft">The programs the agent can start.</span></h2></div>

<div class="panel-foot rules-default is-open"><span class="b b-asked" title="Wide open: a contract usually narrows this"><svg class="i" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="/static/sprite.svg#i-triangle-alert"/></svg>Open</span><span>Can run any program.</span><a class="link r-narrow" href="/rules/change?c=…PATH">Narrow this</a></div></section><section class="panel rules-g" aria-labelledby="g-network"><div class="panel-head"><h2 id="g-network"><svg class="i" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="/static/sprite.svg#i-activity"/></svg>Network <span class="soft">Where the agent can connect.</span></h2></div>

<div class="panel-foot rules-default is-open"><span class="b b-asked" title="Wide open: a contract usually narrows this"><svg class="i" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="/static/sprite.svg#i-triangle-alert"/></svg>Open</span><span>Can connect to any address. Other programs&#39; local sockets stay closed (see Always on).</span><a class="link r-narrow" href="/rules/change?c=…PATH">Narrow this</a></div></section><section class="panel rules-g" aria-labelledby="g-env"><div class="panel-head"><h2 id="g-env"><svg class="i" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="/static/sprite.svg#i-key-round"/></svg>Settings it gets <span class="soft">Environment variables the agent starts with, by name. Values are never shown here.</span></h2></div>

<div class="panel-foot rules-default is-open"><span class="b b-asked" title="Wide open: a contract usually narrows this"><svg class="i" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="/static/sprite.svg#i-triangle-alert"/></svg>Open</span><span>Gets every variable in your shell, secrets included.</span><a class="link r-narrow" href="/rules/change?c=…PATH">Narrow this</a></div></section><section class="panel rules-g" aria-labelledby="g-limits"><div class="panel-head"><h2 id="g-limits"><svg class="i" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="/static/sprite.svg#i-square"/></svg>Limits <span class="soft">When the run is stopped or slowed down.</span></h2></div>

<div class="panel-foot rules-default"><span>No limits of its own: this computer&#39;s defaults apply.</span></div></section><section class="panel rules-g" aria-labelledby="g-always-on"><div class="panel-head"><h2 id="g-always-on"><svg class="i" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="/static/sprite.svg#i-shield"/></svg>Always on <span class="soft">Protections every run gets, written in no rules file.</span></h2></div>
<div class="tw"><table class="t t-rules" role="table"><caption class="sr">Always on: Protections every run gets, written in no rules file.</caption><thead role="rowgroup"><tr role="row"><th scope="col" role="columnheader">Rule</th><th scope="col" role="columnheader" class="c-effect">Effect</th><th scope="col" role="columnheader" class="c-enf" title="A blank cell: the operating system enforces the rule in full. Only the exceptions are named.">Enforced by <span class="th-sub">kernel unless noted</span></th><th scope="col" role="columnheader" class="c-hits num">In this run</th><th scope="col" role="columnheader" class="c-src">Source</th></tr></thead><tbody role="rowgroup">
<tr role="row"><td role="cell" class="lead">Can never read the usual secret files: SSH and cloud keys, browser profiles, .env files and similar</td><td role="cell" data-label="Effect" class="c-effect"><span class="b b-refused"><svg class="i" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="/static/sprite.svg#i-ban"/></svg>Refused</span></td><td role="cell" data-label="Enforced by" class="c-enf"><span class="zero">—</span></td><td role="cell" data-label="In this run" class="c-hits num"><span class="zero">No hits</span></td><td role="cell" data-label="Source" class="c-src"><span class="mono" title="built in">built in</span></td></tr>
<tr role="row"><td role="cell" class="lead">Cannot reach session services, non-SSH credential agents, system D-Bus, X11 or the listed multiplexer and editor sockets; protects their folders from changes</td><td role="cell" data-label="Effect" class="c-effect"><span class="b b-refused"><svg class="i" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="/static/sprite.svg#i-ban"/></svg>Refused</span></td><td role="cell" data-label="Enforced by" class="c-enf"><span class="zero">—</span></td><td role="cell" data-label="In this run" class="c-hits num"><span class="zero">No hits</span></td><td role="cell" data-label="Source" class="c-src"><span class="mono" title="built in">built in</span></td></tr>
<tr role="row"><td role="cell" class="lead">Cannot reach tego&#39;s control sockets or local control ports; its own runtime folder stays available</td><td role="cell" data-label="Effect" class="c-effect"><span class="b b-refused"><svg class="i" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="/static/sprite.svg#i-ban"/></svg>Refused</span></td><td role="cell" data-label="Enforced by" class="c-enf"><span class="zero">—</span></td><td role="cell" data-label="In this run" class="c-hits num"><span class="zero">No hits</span></td><td role="cell" data-label="Source" class="c-src"><span class="mono" title="built in">built in</span></td></tr>
<tr role="row"><td role="cell" class="lead">Cannot open other terminals; its own terminal and ptys it creates stay available</td><td role="cell" data-label="Effect" class="c-effect"><span class="b b-refused"><svg class="i" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="/static/sprite.svg#i-ban"/></svg>Refused</span></td><td role="cell" data-label="Enforced by" class="c-enf"><span class="zero">—</span></td><td role="cell" data-label="In this run" class="c-hits num"><span class="zero">No hits</span></td><td role="cell" data-label="Source" class="c-src"><span class="mono" title="built in">built in</span></td></tr>
<tr role="row"><td role="cell" class="lead">Can never read or change tego&#39;s records of its runs</td><td role="cell" data-label="Effect" class="c-effect"><span class="b b-refused"><svg class="i" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="/static/sprite.svg#i-ban"/></svg>Refused</span></td><td role="cell" data-label="Enforced by" class="c-enf"><span class="zero">—</span></td><td role="cell" data-label="In this run" class="c-hits num"><span class="zero">No hits</span></td><td role="cell" data-label="Source" class="c-src"><span class="mono" title="built in">built in</span></td></tr>
<tr role="row"><td role="cell" class="lead">Cannot change its own rules file</td><td role="cell" data-label="Effect" class="c-effect"><span class="b b-refused"><svg class="i" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="/static/sprite.svg#i-ban"/></svg>Refused</span></td><td role="cell" data-label="Enforced by" class="c-enf"><span class="zero">—</span></td><td role="cell" data-label="In this run" class="c-hits num"><span class="zero">No hits</span></td><td role="cell" data-label="Source" class="c-src"><span class="mono" title="built in">built in</span></td></tr>
<tr role="row"><td role="cell" class="lead">Cannot reach other programs on this computer through their local sockets (Docker, ssh-agent, the desktop bus)</td><td role="cell" data-label="Effect" class="c-effect"><span class="b b-refused"><svg class="i" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="/static/sprite.svg#i-ban"/></svg>Refused</span></td><td role="cell" data-label="Enforced by" class="c-enf"><span class="zero">—</span></td><td role="cell" data-label="In this run" class="c-hits num"><span class="zero">No hits</span></td><td role="cell" data-label="Source" class="c-src"><span class="mono" title="built in">built in</span></td></tr>
<tr role="row"><td role="cell" class="lead">Can read this computer&#39;s network setup: interface names and addresses, routes, and the nearby machines it has talked to</td><td role="cell" data-label="Effect" class="c-effect"><span class="b b-neutral b-allow"><svg class="i" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="/static/sprite.svg#i-check"/></svg>Allowed</span></td><td role="cell" data-label="Enforced by" class="c-enf"><span class="zero">—</span></td><td role="cell" data-label="In this run" class="c-hits num"><span class="zero">No hits</span></td><td role="cell" data-label="Source" class="c-src"><span class="mono" title="built in">built in</span></td></tr>
<tr role="row"><td role="cell" class="lead">Cannot gain root through sudo or other setuid programs</td><td role="cell" data-label="Effect" class="c-effect"><span class="b b-refused"><svg class="i" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="/static/sprite.svg#i-ban"/></svg>Refused</span></td><td role="cell" data-label="Enforced by" class="c-enf"><span class="zero">—</span></td><td role="cell" data-label="In this run" class="c-hits num"><span class="zero">No hits</span></td><td role="cell" data-label="Source" class="c-src"><span class="mono" title="built in">built in</span></td></tr>
<tr role="row"><td role="cell" class="lead">Writes every refusal and question to a record that cannot be changed unnoticed, and a summary of the rest</td><td role="cell" data-label="Effect" class="c-effect"><span class="b b-neutral"><svg class="i" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="/static/sprite.svg#i-eye"/></svg>Note</span></td><td role="cell" data-label="Enforced by" class="c-enf"><span class="zero">—</span></td><td role="cell" data-label="In this run" class="c-hits num"><span class="zero">No hits</span></td><td role="cell" data-label="Source" class="c-src"><span class="mono" title="built in">built in</span></td></tr>
</tbody></table></div>
</section>


